&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:36.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(4) 退職給付債務及び年金資産の期末残高と連結貸借対照表に計上された退職給付に係る負債及び退職給付に係る資産の調整表&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:9pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:18pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:437.5pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
